WarThunderRPC-Plus
==================

This project was written from scratch, but it stands on two pieces of prior
work and the map metadata it inherits is not the author's own. Both are
credited here.


1. Original concept: ValerieOSD/WarThunderRPC
--------------------------------------------
https://github.com/ValerieOSD/WarThunderRPC

The idea of surfacing War Thunder's localhost:8111 telemetry as a Discord
Rich Presence, the Discord application ID, and the logo asset come from that
project. None of its Python source is reused here; the telemetry client,
state machine, flight analysis and presence builder in this repository are
new code.


2. Map metadata: wtrpc/maps.py
------------------------------
Originally distributed with PowerBroker2/WarThunder
https://github.com/PowerBroker2/WarThunder

`wtrpc/maps.py` is a lookup table of perceptual image hashes to War Thunder
map names and real-world coordinates. It was compiled by Power_Broker and is
redistributed here unmodified as a data table.

IMPORTANT LICENSING CAVEAT: at the time of writing, the upstream project
publishes no LICENSE file and declares no license in its PyPI metadata, so
its terms of reuse are formally unspecified. This file is included in good
faith with attribution, and will be removed on request by its author. It is
data only -- no source code from that project is vendored here. If you need a
cleanly licensed deployment, delete `wtrpc/maps.py`; the application degrades
gracefully and simply stops naming the map.
